<title>POLAND: Exbud buys Polish construction firm stake.</title>
<headline>Exbud buys Polish construction firm stake.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Exbud SA has bought a 46.69 stake in Polish construction and engineering holding Elektromontaz Zachod SA for the company's debt of 1.98 million zlotys, Exbud said.</p>
<p>The Elektromontaz Zachod holding employs 2,348 people and it recorded 1995 net sales of 108 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
